  "description": "Returns alerts using the tracking ID. A tracking ID is generated when third-party integrations publish alerts in Collaborate.\n\n### Changelog\n\n\n*   Added support for the `status` query parameter to filter alerts by status (draft, submitted, published, expired, and scheduled)\n*   The API response now includes the alert `status` field.\nFor analysts, alert access is based on the categories linked to their user role in the Analyst Portal. However, if your role includes the View All Alerts permission, you can access all alerts as preferred. This update does not affect credentials generated before this version.",
